 Foreign Adversarial Battery Dependence Act This bill prohibits the Department of Homeland Security (DHS) from using appropriated funds to procure a battery produced by certain entities, particularly six specific companies owned and operated in China. This prohibition begins on October 1, 2027. The bill allows DHS to waive the prohibition if DHS assesses in the affirmative that (1)...","summarySource":"crs","title":"Decoupling from Foreign Adversarial Battery Dependence Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/1166"},{"bipartisan":false,"cosponsors":1,"crossPartyCosponsors":0,"id":"hr1167-119","introducedDate":"2025-02-10","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-02-10","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Oversight and Government Reform."},"number":"HR 1167","policyArea":"Government Operations and Politics","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Prohibits federal agencies from procuring solar panels manufactured or assembled in China or by Chinese-controlled entities, and requires development of procurement standards and guidelines to implement the restriction within 180 days.","summarySource":"ai","title":"Keep China Out of Solar Energy Act of 2025","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/1167"},{"bipartisan":false,"cosponsors":3,"crossPartyCosponsors":1,"id":"hr504-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-16","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-01-08","actionTime":"15:18:24","text":"The Chair directed the Clerk to notify the Senate of the action of the House."},"number":"HR 504","policyArea":"Native Americans","ranked":true,"stage":"passed_both_chambers","summary":"Miccosukee Reserved Area Amendments Act This bill expands the Miccosukee Reserved Area to include a portion of Everglades National Park in Florida that is known as Osceola Camp. The Department of the Interior, in consultation with the Miccosukee Tribe of Indians, must take appropriate actions to protect structures within the Osceola Camp from flooding.","summarySource":"crs","title":"Miccosukee Reserved Area Amendments Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/504"}],"state":"FL","topCrossPartyCollaborators":[{"bioguideId":"C001125","caucus":"D","count":3,"name":"Troy A. Carter"},{"bioguideId":"G000559","caucus":"D","count":2,"name":"John Garamendi"},{"bioguideId":"G000599","caucus":"D","count":2,"name":"Daniel S. Goldman"},{"bioguideId":"G000583","caucus":"D","count":1,"name":"Josh Gottheimer"},{"bioguideId":"S001205","caucus":"D","count":1,"name":"Mary Gay Scanlon"}]}
